<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<TimeML xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="TimeML_1.2.1.xsd">
  <DOCID>Jason</DOCID>
  <TIMEX3 tid="t0" type="DATE" value="2018-12-01T00:00:00" functionInDocument="CREATION_TIME" temporalFunction="false">2018-12-01</TIMEX3>
  <TEXT>Se <EVENT eid="e1" class="OCCURRENCE">presenta</EVENT> el caso de un varón de 43 años, con antecedentes de <EVENT eid="e2" class="OCCURRENCE">diabetes</EVENT>, que <EVENT eid="e3" class="OCCURRENCE">ingresa</EVENT> por una <EVENT eid="e4" class="OCCURRENCE">pancreatitis</EVENT> aguda alitiásica moderada. A <TIMEX3 tid="t1" type="DURATION" value="P2W" temporalFunction="false">las dos semanas</TIMEX3>, <EVENT eid="e5" class="REPORTING">refiere</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e6" class="OCCURRENCE">dolor</EVENT> agudo en hemiabdomen izquierdo y <EVENT eid="e7" class="OCCURRENCE">náuseas</EVENT>, sin otros <EVENT eid="e8" class="OCCURRENCE">síntomas</EVENT>. A la <EVENT eid="e9" class="OCCURRENCE">exploración</EVENT>, se <EVENT eid="e10" class="REPORTING">palpa</EVENT> una gran <EVENT eid="e11" class="OCCURRENCE">ocupación</EVENT> del hemiabdomen izquierdo sin <EVENT eid="e12" class="OCCURRENCE">irritación</EVENT> peritoneal. <EVENT eid="e13" class="OCCURRENCE">Analítica</EVENT>: <EVENT eid="e14" class="OCCURRENCE">triglicéridos</EVENT> y <EVENT eid="e15" class="OCCURRENCE">lipasa</EVENT> elevados, <EVENT eid="e16" class="OCCURRENCE">resto</EVENT> bioquímica, <EVENT eid="e17" class="OCCURRENCE">hemograma</EVENT> y <EVENT eid="e18" class="OCCURRENCE">coagulación</EVENT> normal. Durante la <EVENT eid="e19" class="OCCURRENCE">exploración</EVENT>, sufre un <EVENT eid="e20" class="OCCURRENCE">síncope</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e21" class="OCCURRENCE">bajando</EVENT> el <EVENT eid="e22" class="OCCURRENCE">hematocrito</EVENT> de 40 al 21%, requiriendo <EVENT eid="e23" class="OCCURRENCE">trasfusión</EVENT> de 6 concentrados de hematíes, quedando <EVENT eid="e24" class="OCCURRENCE">estable</EVENT>. Se realiza <EVENT eid="e25" class="OCCURRENCE">prueba</EVENT> de imagen, que <EVENT eid="e26" class="REPORTING">informa</EVENT> de <EVENT eid="e27" class="OCCURRENCE">pseudoquiste</EVENT> pancreático hemorrágico de 17 x 27 cm de diámetro. El paciente <EVENT eid="e28" class="OCCURRENCE">ingresa</EVENT> en UCI donde permanece <EVENT eid="e29" class="OCCURRENCE">estable</EVENT>. Al cabo de <TIMEX3 tid="t2" type="DURATION" value="P1W" temporalFunction="false">una semana</TIMEX3>, el paciente es <EVENT eid="e30" class="OCCURRENCE">programado</EVENT> para <EVENT eid="e31" class="OCCURRENCE">intervención</EVENT> quirúrgica realizando una <EVENT eid="e32" class="OCCURRENCE">quisto-yeyunostomía</EVENT>. Transcurre <TIMEX3 tid="t3" type="DATE" value="X" temporalFunction="true">un postoperatorio</TIMEX3> sin <EVENT eid="e33" class="OCCURRENCE">incidencias</EVENT>, siendo dado de <EVENT eid="e34" class="OCCURRENCE">alta</EVENT> a <TIMEX3 tid="t4" type="DURATION" value="P1W" temporalFunction="false">la semana</TIMEX3> de la <EVENT eid="e35" class="OCCURRENCE">intervención</EVENT>.&#13;
</TEXT>
